  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "愛依、大丈夫か……？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7019001030020,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "うん……結果、出たんだよね？",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701900103/7019001030020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、でも、落ち着くまで少し待とうか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7019001030030,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "大丈夫、言っちゃって",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701900103/7019001030030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "わかった……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "おめでとう、無事に通過してたぞ！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7019001030040,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "へ……？　マジで……？",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701900103/7019001030040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、本当だ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7019001030050,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "アハハ……よかった～……！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile1",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701900103/7019001030050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "この前のこと、やっぱり気になるのか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7019001030060,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "だってさぁ、あれ\r\nマジにやらかしちゃったやつじゃん？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile1",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701900103/7019001030060"
  },
  {
    "id": 7019001030070,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "プロデューサーにも\r\nちょーメーワクかけちゃったし……",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile1",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701900103/7019001030070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うん、反省するのは大切だ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "けど、そこまで気に病む必要はないぞ\r\n次は挽回すればいいんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7019001030080,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "そー言ってくれるのは嬉しいけどさ～",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile1",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701900103/7019001030080"
  },
  {
    "id": 7019001030090,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "でも、やっぱなんかヤじゃん？\r\nだから、これ以上そーなんないように、頑張る",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile1",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701900103/7019001030090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "愛依、その気持ちでレッスンに励んでいけば\r\nきっと大丈夫だ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "けど、もし不安なことがあったら\r\nなんでも聞いてくるんだぞ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7019001030100,
    "speaker": "愛依",
